  <span class="eyebrow blue">Legal</span><h1>Risk disclosure</h1>
  <p class="lede">Trading leveraged products carries a high level of risk and can result in the loss of all your capital.</p>
  <p>Leverage magnifies losses as well as gains. A small adverse move can cost more than your initial deposit on a leveraged position. You should not trade with money you cannot afford to lose entirely.</p>
  <p>Performance figures shown anywhere on this platform describe past results. They are not a reliable indicator of future results, and no trader, strategy or automated system on this platform is guaranteed to be profitable.</p>
  <p>Advertised returns on investment plans are targets rather than guarantees. Capital placed in a plan is at risk and may return less than the amount placed, including nothing.</p>
  <p>If you do not fully understand how a product works, or how much you stand to lose, seek independent financial advice before trading.</p>
</div></section>
